{"id":"vod_sn_37402","vodId":"37402","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"青春草莓蛋","name_cn":"青春草莓蛋","date":"2001-01-01","year":"2001","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/596c86a4c049984f2e38332205974be7.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在名为青鞜三之宫学院的学校里，这是一所校风非常严谨的学校，崇尚男卑女尊的风气，在学校里，所有的苦活累活都是男生做的，女生天生就站在食物链的顶端。不仅如此，学校里亦拒绝聘用男教师。　　天和响（岸祐二 配音）是刚刚从大学毕业的热血青年，鼓足了劲想要在教育界大展拳脚。为了付清房租，天和响必须在三之宫学院找到一份工作，在房东老太太的建议之下，他决定男扮女装，潜入学校之中。最终，天和响顺利的得到了体育老师的工作，但这只是一切的开始，等待着他的，除了无尽的问题和挑战外，还有对他虎视眈眈的校长。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:52:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CRzQix4DJ71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PR0pKrAtWS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/t9kT9R9NQC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PjnKfXtd6z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PyydAnjMLs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VCxer2RWEt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hbmpNHnV7W1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rkBD7zjjAZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UxGuZiwZ5t1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Pb5VcJqwLB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/H3fNuXyFsu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/w6hRhkFEz61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fNGFtFyH0D1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:11.122Z"}